From 5aa97a7cb0921f3cd4e178fecbad21ba4299ea29 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 21:34:45 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] net: add RAM-only recovery HTTP server

Serve one upload page, receive an application/octet-stream body directly into the approved RAM window, and wait for an acknowledged boot request. The transport does not validate FIT contents or write persistent storage.

The receive structure was informed by hanwckf/bl-mt798x PR 82 and Yuzhii0718/bl-mt798x-dhcpd; this implementation is independently written for bounded RAM-only recovery.

Signed-off-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>
